invariant: INV-16
file: session.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_host
reason: tlsi_record_cpu writes the session's ch_cfg.cpu into the write direction
  alone, so every record a session opens runs under 0, which names no
  fast path: Poly1305 on the decomposition, whatever the value states.
  test/tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul.h counts each end's calls around its
  own calls and requires an end whose ch_cfg.cpu holds
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_MULTIPLY to call no file under its own names.

--- old
    t->rd.cpu = t->cfg.cpu;
--- new
